\ Exp 033: Dictionary manipulation and compiler state access

\ Header layout constants
8 constant h.ct
9 constant h.sz
10 constant h.nm

\ Convenience accessors for compiler state
: H@ H @ ;
: anon@ anon @ ;

\ ct|! — OR a value into the ct byte of a header
\ ( mask hdr-addr -- )
: ct|! 8 + dupc@ rot | swap c! ;

\ pvt` — mark the most recent definition as private (set bit 3)
: pvt` 8 H@ ct|! ;
